PROJECT OVERVIEW & VALUE PROPOSITION GREEN-EYE is a

high-altitude, multi-layered digital intelligence ecosystem powered by the

Gemini AI multimodal architecture. The platform ingests, cross-references, and

analyzes real-time satellite radar imagery, sonar data, and sub-glacial seismic

feeds across Greenland and its territorial waters. The value proposition is

dual-focused: first, it offers sovereign nations and defense pacts predictive

maritime security (detecting dark vessels and illegal extraction); second, it

sells premium, hyper-accurate climate change predictive data to global carbon

markets, insurance conglomerates, and scientific institutions.

3.

TOKENOMICS & FINANCIAL ARCHITECTURE


Proposed Token
Ticker: $ICE

Token Type: Regulated
Security Token / Real World Asset (RWA).

Total Supply: 50,000,000
$ICE Tokens (Fixed).

Target
Fundraising Goal: $6,000,000 USD (Hard Cap).

Token Value
& Utility Matrix:
1.   Data Marketplace Dividends: Every

time a private insurance company, energy firm, or foreign government purchases

specialized climate reports or maritime logs from the GREEN-EYE network, 15% of

the transaction is distributed directly in stablecoins to $ICE token holders.

2.   Subscription Staking:

Institutional clients who wish to have permanent API access to the live

Greenland monitoring dashboard must purchase and stake a substantial amount of

$ICE tokens, creating a constant buying pressure and reducing circulating

supply.

4.

REGULATORY COMPLIANCE & LEGAL FRAMEWORK


Compliance
Standard: ERC-3643 with automated ID verification (KYC/AML) built into the
blockchain ledger.

Asset Backing: The token
value is legally tied to the proprietary AI models, data-pipeline
architectures, and commercial contracts signed with institutional data
buyers.

Target Market: Institutional
investors, Green Bonds funds, ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance)
investors, and geopolitical think-tanks.
